  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Weapon Spell. For 1...6...7 second[s], target ally has a Weapon of Shadow. Whenever that ally is struck by an attack, that ally's attacker becomes Blinded for 5 seconds. The next 1...3...3 times [sic] that ally hits with an attack, his target is Blinded for 5 seconds.",
